@startuml phase8_tcp_disconnect_hypotheses
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Phase 8 TCP切断: 3つの仮説シーケンス比較

participant "Camera\n(ISX012)" as CAM
participant "action_queue\n(MAX=7)" as AQ #LightYellow
participant "TCP Thread\n(Spresense)" as TCP_SP
participant "GS2200M\nWiFi Module" as WIFI #LightBlue
participant "WiFi AP\n(Router)" as AP #LightCyan
participant "OS TCP\nBuffer (PC)" as OS_BUF #LightYellow
participant "TCP Reader\n(PC)" as TCP_PC #LightGreen
participant "GUI Thread\n(PC)" as GUI

== 正常動作 (48分間, 18,942フレーム) ==
CAM -> AQ: push(frame)
note over AQ: depth=4 (安定)
AQ -> TCP_SP: pull()
TCP_SP -> WIFI: send(28KB avg)
note over WIFI: 134ms平均\nバッファ使用中
WIFI -> AP: 802.11g\n1-2Mbps
AP -> OS_BUF: TCP segments
OS_BUF -> TCP_PC: read()
TCP_PC -> GUI: DecodedFrame

note over WIFI,TCP_PC #LightGreen
**正常動作統計**
- PC FPS: 6.74fps
- TCP avg: 134ms
- Error: 0
end note

== ■■■ 切断発生 (seq=27603, 48分後) ■■■ ==

note over CAM,GUI #Pink
**観測事実**
- PC側: "Connection closed (need 56788 bytes, have 21960)"
  → パケットの38.7%受信時点で切断
- Spresense側: "error -107 (ENOTCONN)"
  → 送信中にソケット切断検出
end note

@enduml
